\midrule
\textbf{Continuous Internal Assessment (CIA)} & \textbf{\VAR{ assessment.cia_marks } Marks} & Quizzes, Surprise Tests, Open-book Case Analysis \& Active Learning. \\
\textbf{Mid-Semester Examination (MSE)} & \textbf{\VAR{ assessment.mse_marks } Marks} & 1.5-hour centralized written test covering foundational Modules 1 to 3. \\
\textbf{Practical Internal Assessment (CIAP)} & \textbf{\VAR{ assessment.ciap_marks } Marks} & Continuous evaluation of lab experiments, code reviews, and logbooks. \\
