\textbf{End-Semester Practical Exam (ESEP)} & \textbf{\VAR{ assessment.esep_marks } Marks} & Hands-on lab implementation, viva-voce, and runtime verification. \\
\textbf{Self-Learning Assessment (SLA)} & \textbf{\VAR{ assessment.sla_marks } Marks} & NPTEL/MOOC certification, capstone mini-project, or industrial seminar. \\
